---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="Privacy Policy | NuRenaissance"
  description="How NuRenaissance Media collects, uses and protects your information."
>
  <article class="doc">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">
      Effective Date: August 19, 2026<br />
      Last Updated: November 9, 2026<br />
      Operator: NuRenaissance Media ("we," "us," "our")<br />
      Website: <a href="https://www.nrnszn.com/">https://www.nrnszn.com/</a>
    </p>

    <h2>1. Overview &amp; Platform Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      NuRenaissance Media is a sole proprietorship based in Nashville, Tennessee. Our website is hosted on
      Cloudflare Pages, which delivers the Site to you over a secure connection. Information you submit through
      forms on the Site (such as service requests, surveys and payment notes) is stored in Google services
      (Google Sheets and Google Drive) associated with our business account, which keep data on secure servers.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Information You Provide Directly:</strong> We collect personal information you voluntarily
        provide when you contact us via email, online forms, or inquiries (such as your name, email address,
        phone number, and message content).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Automatically Collected Information:</strong> When you visit the Site, technical information
        such as your IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, and referring website is collected
        automatically to support basic website functionality and security.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to inquiries and communications</li>
      <li>Provide requested information or services</li>
      <li>Maintain and operate the Site</li>
      <li>Protect the security and integrity of the Site</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Marketing Communications:</strong> If you subscribe to our newsletter, we use your email address
        to send you updates about our projects. You may opt out of these communications at any time by clicking
        the "unsubscribe" link included in every marketing email.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      Our site uses cookies and similar tools only where necessary for basic functionality. Third-party content
      embedded on the Site, such as YouTube videos and Google Fonts, may set cookies or collect technical
      information, which is governed by those providers' own privacy policies. You can adjust your browser
      settings to refuse cookies, though some parts of the Site may not function properly as a result.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Sharing Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal information. We use trusted service providers to run the Site and our
      services (including Cloudflare for hosting, Google for form storage, scheduling and email, and Resend for
      sending newsletters), and they process information only on our behalf. Otherwise, we share information
      only when required by law, legal process, or to protect our rights, property, or safety. We do not "sell"
      or "share" your personal information as those terms are defined under applicable privacy laws.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>
      The Site may include links to third-party platforms (such as Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, Apple Music, and
      SoundCloud) and to payment services (such as PayPal, Cash App, and Venmo). We are not responsible for the
      privacy practices or content of those third-party websites.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The Site is not intended for individuals under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
      information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Your Choices &amp; Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      You may choose not to provide personal information or request updates, corrections, or deletion of your
      data by reaching out to us directly via email. As NuRenaissance Media is a sole proprietorship based in
      Nashville, Tennessee, we operate primarily through digital channels.
    </p>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:nurrenaissance@gmail.com">nurrenaissance@gmail.com</a></p>
  </article>
</Site>

<style>
  .doc {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #e6e0f2;
  }
  .doc h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 7vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    color: var(--gold-300);
  }
  .doc .meta { color: #a99fc6; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 var(--space-6); }
  .doc h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-2);
    color: #f3f0fa;
  }
  .doc p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .doc ul { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .doc li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .doc a { color: var(--gold-300); }
  .doc strong { color: #f3f0fa; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
